{"type":"text","timestamp":1789678860754,"sessionID":"ses_f4f2f4e22ffeQEg1lh8ydQJX5C","part":{"id":"prt_0b12c2536001OXSf13E3cDXZXc","messageID":"msg_0b12c1e16001Z92LZUMjkEW7we","sessionID":"ses_f4f2f4e22ffeQEg1lh8ydQJX5C","type":"text","text":"Fix4/B1 remediated — commit `1f67c91a` on `work/702-pipeline-slice-3` (6 files, +757/−33), two native subagents with isolated files plus manager-owned seams and independent gate verification.\n\n## Session evidence\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Base | `645bc1e6` → new `1f67c91a` |\n| Docs routing | manager ran `docs_read.py` for `bins/eliot-dreamer` (receipt `bbb85de4`, bundle `bd3b67e3`, 25 required items) before any edit |\n| Codebase Memory | project `…-work-702-dreamer`: `KernelClient::load/transact_json` recon (no test constructor → injected-transport design), material/grant field visibility, `ClaimTransport` seam |\n| Subagents (isolated writers, no commits) | Agent A `ses_f4ee03705ffe…` (`lib.rs` only) · Agent B `ses_f4ee036eeffe…` (`pipeline_e2e.rs` + additive `curation_test_support` only) |\n| Manager seams | `kernel_port.rs` Box blanket impl, `CurationExecutionCarrier` → `pub`, brace repair, early-stop test repair (empty-routes premise was dead: screen binding verification rejects first), production-warning allows, gates, commit |\n\n## Design (answers auditor §1–2)\n- `pub trait CurationCarrierSource` (object-safe, `resolve_carrier(&screen, &admission, &job)`) — the Governor injection point; `submit` resolves the carrier from the A-20 screen binding and passes it into `run_admitted_pipeline`. Absent → precise `InvalidAdmission` fail-closed preserved.\n- `AuthenticatedKernelJobPort<'a>` holds `transport: Box<dyn ClaimTransport>` (blanket impl keeps generic `claim_once`/`status_once` untouched) + `curation_source: Option<&'a dyn CurationCarrierSource>` (`connect()` = `None`, `with_curation_source` builder for Governor wiring, `#[cfg(test)] for_test` with zero Kernel contact).\n- `submit` branches Curation early (after Slice-A + claim check, before Slice-2 controller/bundle which govern only the generic track) — screen → carrier → A-31 → shared `finish_with_result` tail.\n\n## Test evidence (all run by manager)\n- `cargo test --locked -p eliot-dreamer --all-targets` → **97 lib + 9 bin passed, 0 failed**, incl. 4 new public-path submit tests: source → A-31 exactly once (`calls()==1`) then transport-closed fail (proves screen-first, no generic stages, injection honored); no-source → exact carrier message; refused class → `UnsupportedJobClass`; Orientation → controller gate. Typed-result content proven at chain level (submit in-process cannot pass `live_view` without a Kernel — stated in test docs).\n- `cargo clippy --locked -p eliot-dreamer --all-targets` → zero warnings in scope production code (fixed ours: `large_enum_variant` allow with precedent, main.rs dead/stderr allows); remainder is pre-existing `expect_used` test style (present on base in merged files) + untouched dep lints.\n- `git diff --check` → clean.","time":{"start":1789678855478,"end":1789678860753},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_01a0b12c1c0f772fbf657e68dec47618"}}}}
